WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.862
Library workspace ki jaankari yahan hai, aur sirf aapki library tak seemit rehti hai.

00:00:05.962 --> 00:00:13.377
Manage mein Team & roles se staff ko seemit access dein, jaise sirf attendance ya sirf payments.

00:00:13.478 --> 00:00:19.383
Activity tab mein dikhta hai kisne, kab, kya badla.
